&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;5b08d69496c1&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;5b082e816f3c&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;How to Apply: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;hardBreak&quot; data-prosemirror-node-inline=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Apply directly via the form below for the position of Software Engineer Intern. Please provide us with a CV in English. Unfortunately we cannot accept applications via email for data protection reasons.&lt;br data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;hardBreak&quot; data-prosemirror-node-inline=&quot;true&quot;&gt;If your application is selected to proceed to the next round, you will be required to complete online assessments. By submitting your application you are confirming that you will be able to take the assessment within 7 days.&lt;br data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;hardBreak&quot; data-prosemirror-node-inline=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Kindly note that we do not require any assistance from third-parties including agencies in the recruitment of this role. If you have any questions feel free to contact our Recruitment team via the &lt;a href=&quot;https://optiver.com/contact-eu-recruitment&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;link&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;underline&quot;&gt;contact form&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;7e1e62446af6&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;4a5d06157788&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;Diversity statement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;5bb734445dec&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Optiver is committed to &lt;a href=&quot;https://optiver.com/diversity-statement/&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;link&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;underline&quot;&gt;diversity and inclusion&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;dd992b2ad2f5&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;We encourage applications from candidates from any and all backgrounds, and we welcome requests for reasonable adjustments during the process to ensure that you can best demonstrate your abilities. Please let us know if you would like to request any reasonable adjustments by contacting the Recruitment team &lt;a href=&quot;https://optiver.com/contact-eu-recruitment/&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;link&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;underline&quot;&gt;via the contact form&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, selecting &quot;Reasonable Adjustments&quot; as the subject of your inquiry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;fde057a4b823&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;For answers to some of our most frequently asked questions, refer to our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.optiver.com/join-us/stories/optiver-europe-recruitment-faq/&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;link&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;underline&quot;&gt;FAQs&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;7bc4edb2a79a&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;For applicants based in India, our entry route is via the placement office internship hiring season (July/August).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;ad9362455f71&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;Optiver has a global application re-apply policy for our intern and graduate roles. If you have completed an online assessment or interviewed for a technology graduate or internship role at any Optiver location in the past 8 months, please note that you are not yet eligible to reapply. We welcome you to re-apply after the 8-month cool off period.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;29&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a> Software  London

Data Director, Payments &lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;🚀 We’re on a mission to make money work for everyone.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re waving goodbye to the complicated and confusing ways of traditional banking.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;After starting as a prepaid card, our product offering has grown a lot in the last 10 years in the UK. As well as&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/personal&quot;&gt;personal&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/business-banking&quot;&gt;business&lt;/a&gt; bank accounts, we offer &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/joint-account&quot;&gt;joint accounts&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/16-17&quot;&gt;accounts for 16-17 year olds&lt;/a&gt;, a &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/under-16s&quot;&gt;free kids account&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/flex&quot;&gt;credit cards&lt;/a&gt; in the UK, with more exciting things to come beyond. Our UK customers can also &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/savings&quot;&gt;save&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/investments&quot;&gt;invest &lt;/a&gt;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/pensions&quot;&gt;combine their pensions&lt;/a&gt; with us.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With our hot coral cards and get-paid-early feature, combined with financial education on social media and our award winning customer service, we have a long history of creating magical moments for our customers!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re not about selling products - we want to solve problems and change lives through Monzo ❤️&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;📍London or UK Remote | 💰 £150,000 - £200, 000 + Equity +&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/careers/&quot;&gt; Benefits&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About our Data Discipline&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a strong culture of data-driven decision making across the whole company. Data is central to how we understand our customers, shape our products, manage risk and grow Monzo sustainably. We believe in empowering teams with high-quality, trusted data and self-serve analytics, while creating space for Data practitioners to focus on the highest-impact questions, opportunities and decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Data discipline is centralised, but deeply embedded in Monzo’s product areas. Data Scientists, Analytics Engineers, Machine Learning Engineers and Analysts work in cross-functional squads alongside Engineers, Designers, Product Managers, Marketers and other specialists. This means Data is not a downstream service: we help shape strategy, challenge thinking, build the data foundations teams need to move quickly, and share accountability for customer and commercial outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Payments team ⭐&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Monzo, payments are more than just moving money from A to B. They are a core part of how customers experience trust, speed, and financial control every day. As a Data Director in Payments, you would help shape seamless local payment experiences, ensuring customers can pay and get paid reliably while continuing to modernise the infrastructure that powers millions of transactions behind the scenes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role also sits at the intersection of Monzo’s broader ambition to build truly borderless banking and expand into new markets. That means designing products and payment capabilities that work effortlessly across geographies, currencies, and customer needs, while helping Monzo scale into new markets with the same simplicity and transparency that defines the brand today.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll partner closely with Product, Engineering, and Design to help shape Monzo’s payments strategy to make Monzo&#39;s global ambitions a reality, enabling revenue and customer growth with a resilient, self-serve banking platform.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To succeed, you should be excited about solving tough, ambiguous business problems with analytical rigour, commercial viability and execution effectiveness&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your day-to-day&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish yourself as a trusted member of the Payments Leadership team, enabling better decisions across Payments and the wider Data Discipline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Co-drive Payments strategy and product decisions with Product and Engineering, bringing Data into discovery early to shape priorities and challenge thinking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify untapped opportunities for commercial optimisation, including across pricing, commercialisation, investment and customer growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the data strategy for Payments, including the operating model, team priorities, architecture, technical debt and key metrics and drivers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate between technical, product and commercial perspectives to help teams make clear, high-impact decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and scale a high-performing team of data professionals sharing accountability for product and business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You should apply if:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What we’re doing here at Monzo excites you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience driving payments innovation and product strategy forward in a fast-growing business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You combine deep Data expertise with strong product and commercial judgement.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can move comfortably from detailed metrics or architecture discussions to customer strategy, pricing and business outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are an empathetic people leader who can build trust quickly, raise the performance bar and retain excellent talent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience growing and leading a full stack data team, including individual contributors and managers across Data Science, Analytics Engineering, Machine Learning Engineering and Analytics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience collaborating with senior cross-functional stakeholders across Product, Engineering, Design, Marketing and risk/control functions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Interview Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;After an informal ~30 min recruiter call, our interview process involves 2 main stages. We promise not to ask you any brain teasers or trick questions!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Initial Call (1 hour)&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll meet with one of our senior data leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Loop Stage&lt;/strong&gt; - This is one stage with 4 interviews (totalling 4 hours) split between a collaboration with one of our engineers on a technical exercise, as well as behavioural and leadership interviews. You can have this all in one day or split these across multiple days, whichever your prefer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our average process takes around 3-4 weeks but we will always work around your availability. You will have the chance to speak to our recruitment team at various points during your process but if you do have any specific questions ahead of this please contact us on -----
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How we work 💻:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Locations &amp;amp; Flexible Working :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our main tech hub is in London, but our engineers live everywhere in the UK— from Brighton to the Western Isles.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We value meeting in person but there’s no pressure to come into the office, even if you&#39;re nearby. We believe you&#39;ll do your best work if you are where you want to be. If you live outside of London and we ask you to come into the office, Monzo will support you with the costs. ✨&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our offices are naturally social, especially Tuesdays, Wednesdays and Thursdays, which happen to line up with our twice-weekly Monzo lunches &amp;amp; treat Thursdays 🍽️. Teams also schedule time together often for work and play – in or around the office, or online.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set up a work schedule that delivers impact and fits your life.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Monzo, we value connections, flexibility, and wellbeing. We keep our meetings during core hours to stay connected and believe in maintaining work/life balance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be empowered to manage your work in a way that suits you and your team, giving you the freedom for children drop-offs and pick-ups, walking your dog or adventurous cat, avoiding peak commuting times or gym slots, appointments, or supporting your family in an emergency. 🕒✨&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work the way that works for you with Monzo! 💼&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s in it for you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💰Base salary £150, 000 - £200, 000 + Equity + &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/careers/&quot;&gt;Benefits&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✈️ We can help you relocate to the UK&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✅ We can sponsor visas&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📍This role can be based in our London office, but we&#39;re open to distributed working within the UK (with ad hoc meetings in London).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;⏰ We offer flexible working hours and trust you to work enough hours to do your job well, at times that suit you and your team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📚Learning budget of £1,000 a year for books, training courses and conferences&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-AL1 #LI-REMOTE&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/careers/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunities for everyone&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Diversity and inclusion are a priority for us and we’re making sure we have lots of support for all of our people to grow at Monzo. At Monzo, we’re embracing diversity by fostering an inclusive environment for all people to do the best work of their lives with us. This is integral to our mission of making money work for everyone. You can read more in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/diversity-and-inclusion&quot;&gt;blog&lt;/a&gt;, 2026 &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/our-2026-diversity-and-inclusion-report&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Diversity and Inclusion Report&lt;/a&gt; and 2025 &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/gender-pay-gap-report-2025&quot;&gt;Gender Pay Gap Report.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re an equal opportunity employer. All applicants will be considered for employment without attention to age, ethnicity, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, family or parental status, national origin, or veteran, neurodiversity or disability status.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a preferred name, please use it to apply. We don&#39;t need full or birth names at application stage 😊&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a> Data  Cardiff

Manager, Media Analytics UK &lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:280}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SharkNinja&amp;nbsp;is a global product design and technology company, with a diversified portfolio of 5-star rated lifestyle solutions that positively&amp;nbsp;impact&amp;nbsp;people’s lives in homes around the world. &lt;strong&gt;Powered by two trusted, global brands, Shark and Ninja&lt;/strong&gt;, the company has a proven&amp;nbsp;track record&amp;nbsp;of bringing disruptive innovation to market and developing one consumer product after another has allowed&amp;nbsp;SharkNinja&amp;nbsp;to enter multiple product categories, driving significant growth and market share gains. Headquartered in Needham, Massachusetts with more than&amp;nbsp;4,100&amp;nbsp;associates, the company’s products are sold at key retailers, online and offline, and through distributors around the world.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI at SharkNinja &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At SharkNinja, we’re building an AI-native culture. We’re not waiting for the future; we’re creating it. Our people are expected to experiment boldly, adopt new tools, and continuously raise what’s possible to create meaningful impact for our consumers. If you believe the best way to do your job hasn’t been invented yet, you’ll fit right in.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manager, Media Analytics - UK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SharkNinja is a global product design and technology company, with a diversified portfolio of 5-star rated lifestyle solutions that positively impact people&#39;s lives in homes around the world. Powered by two trusted, global brands, Shark and Ninja, the company has a proven track record of bringing disruptive innovation to market, and developing one consumer product after another has allowed SharkNinja to enter multiple product categories, driving significant growth and market share gains. Headquartered in Needham, Massachusetts with more than 3,300+ associates, the company&#39;s products are sold at key retailers, online and offline, and through distributors around the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We don&#39;t just make products. We identify and solve customer problems, some that customers don&#39;t even know they have. We tell that story via social, digital, broadcast, print, and retail media across organic, paid, influencer, and earned channels.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re seeking a Manager, Media Analytics to lead predictive measurement of our media investments across channels—building forward-looking models that anticipate performance, uncover insights, and fuel smarter, faster decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will join a growing Global Marketing Analytics Team, transforming data into clear actions that optimize marketing performance and guide media, social, and creative strategies. The ideal candidate will thrive in SharkNinja&#39;s fast-moving culture — balancing rigor with pragmatism and using predictive data not only to measure performance but to influence decisions and spark the next opportunity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is based in London, UK and sits within our EMEA Marketing Analytics team, with primary responsibility for the UK market. While primarily supporting the UK, the role also provides analytical support to the Nordics and other emerging European markets as needed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Predictive Modelling: &lt;/strong&gt;Build and maintain predictive and forecasting models—spanning MMM, attribution, and incrementality—to anticipate media performance and guide allocation decisions before results are final.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KPI Measurement: &lt;/strong&gt;Own the metrics that matter, ensuring media activity is measured against clear goals and forecasted with increasing precision over time, and that agency partners are held accountable against these benchmarks through robust governance and performance management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Channel Optimization: &lt;/strong&gt;Partner with internal teams and agencies to pivot strategies based on real-time insights and forward-looking model outputs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Audience and Creative Effectiveness: &lt;/strong&gt;Partner with internal teams and agencies to analyse audience and creative effectiveness across SharkNinja&#39;s product categories, leading with data-informed insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brand &amp;amp; Talent Evaluation: &lt;/strong&gt;Monitor and report out on brand health and ambassador performance by analysing consumer sentiment data, ensuring celebrity investments align with SharkNinja&#39;s brand identity and drive measurable advertising lift.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Signal Detection: &lt;/strong&gt;Proactively identify signals, anomalies, or emerging patterns in media and market data to flag risks or opportunities before they escalate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting &amp;amp; Dashboards: &lt;/strong&gt;Build and maintain concise, audience-appropriate dashboards that highlight what&#39;s working, what isn&#39;t, and where predictive models point next. Collaborate with Data &amp;amp; Engineering teams to maintain the integrity of the media analytics ecosystem, where data quality is validated, and dashboards provide accurate, actionable insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Insights to Action: &lt;/strong&gt;Translate complex, model-driven data into compelling stories that lead to concrete recommendations and immediate adjustments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team &amp;amp; Stakeholder Partnership: &lt;/strong&gt;Mentor junior analysts and partner closely with regional marketing, brand, performance and agency stakeholders to embed predictive thinking into day-to-day media decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Market Ownership: &lt;/strong&gt;Act as the primary analytics partner for the UK market, tailoring measurement frameworks, KPIs, and recommendations to reflect the UK&#39;s stage of market maturity, while extending analytical support to the Nordics and other emerging markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Attributes &amp;amp; Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s or Master&#39;s degree in Marketing, Data Science, Statistics, Economics, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of experience in marketing analytics within a consumer-driven industry, with direct experience building or applying predictive/forecasting models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong grasp of both digital performance channels and traditional media measurement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercially curious mindset that goes beyond the numbers, to understand marketing effectiveness and commercial outcomes. Constantly asks “so what?” and “what should we do differently?” to influence better business decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience delivering analytics across emerging, growth, and mature markets, with the ability to tailor measurement frameworks, KPIs, benchmarks, and recommendations to reflect the different objectives and stages of market maturity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with MMM, attribution, or incrementality methodologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with building in AI tools such as Claude.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience collaborating with agencies and cross-functional teams to act on insights quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to simplify complexity, focusing on insights that drive business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and presentation skills to influence decision-makers at all levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating in a fast-paced, agile environment with shifting priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;For this London-based role, familiarity with additional European languages (e.g. Nordic languages) is a plus, given occasional coverage of the Nordics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our Culture&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;At SharkNinja, we don’t just raise the bar—we push past it every single day. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our Outrageously Extraordinary mindset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; drives us to tackle the impossible, push boundaries, and deliver results that others only dream of. If you thrive on breaking out of your swim lane, you’ll be right at home.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What We Offer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We offer competitive health insurance, retirement plans, paid time off, employee stock purchase options, wellness programs, SharkNinja product discounts, and more.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We empower your personal and professional growth &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;with high impact Learning Programs featuring bold voices redefining what’s possible. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;When you join, you’re not just part of a company—you’re part of an outrageously extraordinary community. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;To&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;gether, we won’t just launch products—&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;we’ll disrupt entire markets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;At SharkNinja, Diversity, Equity, and Inclusion are vital to our global success. Valuing each unique voice and blending all of our diverse skills strengthens SharkNinja’s innovation every day. We support ALL associates in bringing their authentic selves to work, making an impact, and having the opportunity for career acceleration. With help from our leadership, associates, and our community, we aim to have equity be a key component of the SharkNinja DNA.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
